deepbet     (https://github.com/wwu-mmll/deepbet)

T1Prep runs the segmentation networks of deepmriprep and the skull-stripping
networks of deepbet.  Their weights are redistributed, converted to
safetensors files (downloaded by T1Prep on first use), and the code that
prepares the images for the networks and assembles their results
(src/t1prep/stages, src/t1prep/nn, parts of src/t1prep/utils.py) is a port
of the corresponding code of the two packages.  Reference:

  Fisch L. et al., "deepmriprep: Voxel-based Morphometry (VBM) Preprocessing
  via Deep Neural Networks", arXiv:2408.10656.
  https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2408.10656

